      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1070523899,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Yes, that is the plan. Also\n- [TCP: cleanup ECN related flags](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/a033dc7dc6ddcb8a096a0b44d22477b3bce2a1f1)\n- [TCP: Add support for TARR option](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/c2574b72f405221e52bc8ef7b0e78c8772fa39ce)\n- [TCP: Implement AccECN](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/ecefcf880121961c03d2ec05ad378c82e951e0a2)\n\nAnd possibly also two tweaks to the TCP option handler and some improvements for BBLog. These are upcoming.",
